{"unit_id":"qianen6__dsh-turbo-agent#card-zh","repo":"qianen6/dsh-turbo-agent","commit":"4644b54e9f2e38111c99bf96571ee99f3c70e633","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH TurboAgent 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 网页客户端的模型接入插件：它注册隐藏的 TurboAgent 模型路由，并管理本机验证代理。选择模式后，可按 Flash、Pro 或 Vision 模型生成多个候选，由验证器选出结果；设置页可调整各模型候选数和推理强度，并查看本地验证轨迹。适合希望在 Harness 中启用多候选回答与自动比较的用户。需要在 Harness 配置 DEEPSEEK_API_KEY，并使用 Windows 与 Python 环境。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:477-512","preset/turbo-agent/turbo-agent-mode.mjs:22-45","lib/client.js:229-355","python/dsh_backend.py:136-169"]}
